single editor has no resize handles
loading the BL browser controller preserves deferred commands before the language is ready
drag moves only adjacent columns, preserves editors and retains separator focus
internal column changes update editor wrapping/caret cell measurements
keyboard arrows resize by 16px; Shift resizes by 64px
Escape cancels a captured drag and restores exact previous width declarations
pointer cancellation restores widths and releases capture
native browser touch events resize columns through the same BL controller
drag and keyboard enforce a 120px minimum for both neighboring panes
Enter and double-click remove overrides and restore package layout defaults
unpublished insert-mode draft, selection and history survive resizing and viewport changes
unusing the layout package removes every handle and frame width override
passive minimap resizes; unloading a layout during pointer capture leaves no handles
no browser exceptions
